title: "R scripts for serum proteomic analysis in spinal and bulbar muscular atrophy"
version: 1.0.0
type: software
license: MIT
message: "Please cite this software using the citation information provided below."
abstract: >
  R scripts used for data processing, differential protein analysis,
  clinical correlation analysis, PLS-DA, and figure generation in a
  serum proteomic study of spinal and bulbar muscular atrophy.
